{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18512","headline":"咏德上太原李尚书 · 欧阳詹","name":"咏德上太原李尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"那以公方郭细侯，幷州非复旧幷州。\n九重帝宅司丹地，十万兵枢拥碧油。\n锵玉半爲趋合吏，腰金皆是走庭流。\n王襃见德空知颂，身在三千最上头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18512.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18512","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}